{"id":"m1","ok":true,"result":{"count":5,"docs":[{"_rev":0,"body_preview":"# Pricing page\nThree tiers, annual billing shown first. The release of v2 waits for legal to sign off the new terms.","body_truncated":false,"created":"2026-09-09T09:15:00Z","id":"0787b26d-9e2e-4be5-ab66-ec953102fad3","modified":"2026-09-14T09:15:00Z","project":"website","source":"notes/pricing.md","standing":false,"title":"pricing-page-decisions"},{"_rev":0,"body_preview":"---\ndescription: How an SDK release is cut, tagged and announced\n---\nCut the release branch on Monday, tag after the canary has run for a day, and announce in t","body_truncated":true,"created":"2026-09-05T09:15:00Z","id":"eb864f1e-e68a-4d96-af89-597bd0d2d52e","modified":"2026-09-10T09:15:00Z","project":"api","source":"docs/release.md","standing":false,"title":"release-process"},{"_rev":0,"body_preview":"The handover happens Friday at 16:00. Walk the open incidents, the error budget and anything paged twice in the week, then rotate the pager.","body_truncated":false,"created":"2026-08-29T09:15:00Z","id":"1bce1a9b-5134-4ab7-8665-34cd79fe0c5f","modified":"2026-09-03T09:15:00Z","project":"infra","source":null,"standing":false,"title":"on-call-handover"},{"_rev":0,"body_preview":"The refresh race happens when two requests see an expired token at once. Serialise refresh behind one lock and retry the losing request.","body_truncated":false,"created":"2026-08-22T09:15:00Z","id":"b3bd4390-2124-42ac-829d-f542ecde8a07","modified":"2026-08-27T09:15:00Z","project":"mobile","source":null,"standing":false,"title":"android-token-refresh"},{"_rev":0,"body_preview":"Dr. Visser, Tuesdays and Thursdays, book two weeks ahead.","body_truncated":false,"created":"2026-08-08T09:15:00Z","id":"091eb5ff-05d5-4cb2-ba2f-0afdc77f7935","modified":"2026-08-13T09:15:00Z","project":null,"source":null,"standing":false,"title":"dentist"}],"next_offset":null,"total":5},"tasqx":"1"}
